flowchart LR
  User[开发者] --> CLI[RepoPilot CLI]
  User --> Web[本地 Web 控制台]
  CLI --> Core[Agent Core]
  Web --> Core
  Core --> Context[仓库上下文]
  Core --> Runtime[Agent Runtime]
  Core --> Policy[审批与安全策略]
  Runtime --> Tools[受控工具]
  Tools --> Git[Git Worktree]
  Tools --> FS[文件系统]
  Tools --> Exec[命令/测试执行器]
  Runtime --> LLM[LLM Provider]
  Core --> Events[JSONL 事件记录]
  Events --> Report[Diff/测试/风险报告]
